<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ultramar raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ultramar raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities has upgraded its rating for Ultramar Diamond Shamrock Corp to buy from hold, a source at the brokerage said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares were unchanged at 29.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
